# external/ is ignored repo-wide by the root .gitignore (`external/` entry) —
# that is the primary mechanism.
#
# This nested file is defense-in-depth only: if the root `external/` entry is
# ever removed, `*` still keeps cloned research repos out, and `!.gitignore`
# keeps this file itself tracked. Anything placed here is never committed
# (use `git add -f` only if you really mean it).
*
!.gitignore
